<title>USA: Ohio Gov. makes appointment to building authority.</title>
<headline>Ohio Gov. makes appointment to building authority.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Ohio Gov. George Voinovich on Friday appointed C. Francis Barrett to the Ohio Building Authority board.</p>
<p>Barrett, president of the law firm of Barrett &amp; Webster, replaces Bart Wolstein, who resigned. Barrett's term on the board ends Dec. 31, 1997.</p>
<p>--Karen Pierog, 312-408-8647</p>
